{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Undusted: Letters from the Past, you are tasked with cleaning long-neglected dirty objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you clean each belonging, you will learn the backstories behind the various objects placed in each chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/7ff224faa6d3815ed48e38b24d56f20d.avif?t=1757499166\" width=610 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adora returns home after her mother's passing.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > She starts to clean long ignored items within the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As each object is restored to its pristine condition, the items start whispering memories of the past to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As she cleans more items, she discovers forgotten and even hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What kinds of stories will she experience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Virtual ASMR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/d4635374156eadbf43ed6f2c9efa8747.poster.avif?t=1757499166\" width=608 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/d4635374156eadbf43ed6f2c9efa8747.webm?t=1757499166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/d4635374156eadbf43ed6f2c9efa8747.mp4?t=1757499166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the carefully crafted audio that captures the characteristic of each tool you use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The different ambient sounds of each chapter will make you feel as if you are actually in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Touching Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/0fd3c48011746467405e9d73694663b1.poster.avif?t=1757499166\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/0fd3c48011746467405e9d73694663b1.webm?t=1757499166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/0fd3c48011746467405e9d73694663b1.mp4?t=1757499166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Recall the memories within each object.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Where did Adora and her mother's relationship start to fall apart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will she be able to understand her mother after her passing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Charming Art Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/94efb29f2d92b914334e4bb2f71a8c5e.poster.avif?t=1757499166\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/94efb29f2d92b914334e4bb2f71a8c5e.webm?t=1757499166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/extras/94efb29f2d92b914334e4bb2f71a8c5e.mp4?t=1757499166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Appreciate the captivating art style that is uniquely expressed with pixelated textures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a heartfelt and emotional story about family. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forget about time limits and failure. Just relax and enjoy! The items won't break like they do in real life! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Admire the beautiful artwork that elegantly expresses Adora's story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen to the sensual original background music, which complements the relaxing gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy the oddly satisfying sensation you get in ASMR and Restoration videos in a game! </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891020?t=1757499166","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891020?t=1757499166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/9ab7ae95ade99cb91db1dafc5ded4f200a58eeb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757499166","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891020/9ab7ae95ade99cb91db1dafc5ded4f200a58eeb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757499166","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2994170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Undusted: Letters from the Past, you are tasked with cleaning long-neglected dirty objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you clean each belonging, you will learn the backstories behind the various objects placed in each chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph